  <title>Mailing list printing</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>General</gui><gui>Mailing list printing</gui></guiseq>
  prints the mailing template, addressed to each contact, for everyone on a
  <link xref="mailing_lists">mailing list</link>.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Mailing list</gui>. Its contacts are listed,
    with how many there are and how many addresses are still to
    print.</p></item>
    <item><p>Click <gui>Print mailing list</gui>. A copy prints for each
    contact not yet marked <gui>Printed</gui>, and each is marked as it
    prints.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p>Check or uncheck <gui>Printed</gui> on a contact to include or leave
  them out of the next printing. <gui>Set all unprinted</gui> starts a new
  mailing to the whole list; <gui>Set all printed</gui> marks everyone as done.
  <gui>Refresh contacts</gui> reloads the list.</p>

  <p>Right click a contact for their <gui>Contact hub</gui>, or <gui>View
  mailing file</gui> to open their copy in LibreOffice. <gui>Report
  hub</gui> exports the list; see <link xref="report_hub"/>.</p>

</page>
